 "_comment": "Lists the collaboration events in the permanent campaign (normal_activity: one tag per collab, at most 4 chapters a tag) and makes them permanent (mission_event type 2). Banners: the event list loads Pics/Title/<bg_code>, so each collab's mission-select image (Pics/Icons/OPS) gets a second path there (\"art\"). story_util: Operation Rabbit Hunt (BlazBlue / Guilty Gear, campaign -8) lost its rows in the EN tables, so its maps played no story; its story files are still in the game. Rows 98001-98004 restore them, laid out like the other old events' (start -8-<stage>-1, first-clear -8-<stage>-2First, later clears -8-<stage>-2End where there is one), titled with the map's own name.",
